-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §29 ליווי טיולים ופעילות בית ספרית ביישום
-- חלקי של הרפורמה: in תשע"ד §21 applies to teaching employees to whom the
-- reform is applied in part that year; in תשע"ב–תשע"ג the rules on
-- rewarding trips and school activity in force on the eve of the signing.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-21`

§ `29 ליווי טיולים ופעילות בית ספרית ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

DECLARE `the rules on rewarding trips and school activity` IS ONE OF
    `the rules of section 21`
    `the rules in force on the eve of the signing`

-- ¶1: in תשע"ד, §21 applies to teaching employees to whom the reform is
-- applied in part that year (§21 itself speaks of those under it in full).
-- ¶2, "למען הסר ספק": in תשע"ב–תשע"ג, the rules on rewarding the escort of
-- trips and school activity in force on the eve of the signing (13.8.2011)
-- apply to them. Of a teaching employee off the reform, or under it in
-- full, the section does not speak (NOTHING).
@ref akn:art_29/p1 akn:art_29/p2
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A MAYBE `the rules on rewarding trips and school activity`
DECIDE `the rules section 29 applies in` y e IS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT e EQUALS `the Oz reform in part` THEN NOTHING
        IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` THEN JUST `the rules of section 21`
        IF `the school year` y `is from` `the school year 5772` `to` `the school year 5773`
        THEN JUST `the rules in force on the eve of the signing`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

`why the rules in force on the eve of the signing are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים בעניין תגמול עבור ליווי טיולים ופעילות בית ספרית שהיו קיימים ערב חתימת ההסכם (13.8.2011)"

§§ `29 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the rules section 29 applies in` `the school year 5774` `the Oz reform in part` EQUALS JUST `the rules of section 21`
#ASSERT `the rules section 29 applies in` `the school year 5773` `the Oz reform in part` EQUALS JUST `the rules in force on the eve of the signing`
#ASSERT `the rules section 29 applies in` `the school year 5774` `the Oz reform in full` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the rules section 29 applies in` `the school year 5775` `the Oz reform in part` EQUALS NOTHING
-- §29 reaches whom §21 does not: §21 governs in full application only
#ASSERT NOT `section 21 governs the reward for activity in` `the school year 5774` `the Oz reform in part`
